@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA

' ==== note（コメント）: 控えめなグレー ====
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #BDBDBD
  FontColor #757575
}

' ==== actor（外部）: グレー ====
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E0E0E0
  BorderColor #757575
  FontColor #424242
}

' ==== database / table: グレー ====
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #E0E0E0
  BorderColor #757575
  FontColor #424242
}

' ==== queue: グレー ====
skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor #E0E0E0
  BorderColor #757575
  FontColor #424242
}

' ==== participant デフォルト: Application（青） ====
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
  FontColor #0D47A1
}

queue KafkaTopic

' Presentation（Consumer）: オレンジ
participant SendEmailConsumer as Consumer #FFE0B2

' Application（Command）: デフォルトの青
participant SendEmailCommand as Command

' Domain: 緑
participant NotificationHistory as History #C8E6C9

' Infrastructure: 紫
participant AdvisoryLockService as Lock #E1BEE7
participant NotificationHistoryRepository as HistoryRepo #E1BEE7
participant EmailSender #E1BEE7

' Database / External: グレー
database NotificationHistoryTable as HistoryTable
participant "SES / SMTP" as EmailService #E0E0E0

KafkaTopic -> Consumer: SendEmailCommandEventInput
Consumer -> Command: execute(command)

Command -> Lock: acquireLock(eventId)
note right: トランザクション終了時に自動解放

Command -> HistoryRepo: existsByEventId(eventId)
HistoryRepo -> HistoryTable: SELECT EXISTS
HistoryTable --> HistoryRepo: false
HistoryRepo --> Command: false
note right: 冪等性チェック\n（既に処理済みならスキップ）

Command -> EmailSender: send(to, subject, body, ...)
EmailSender -> EmailService: send email
EmailService --> EmailSender: success

Command -> History: NotificationHistory.create(eventId, emailType, userId)
History --> Command: history

Command -> HistoryRepo: insert(history)
HistoryRepo -> HistoryTable: INSERT notification_history
HistoryTable --> HistoryRepo

Command --> Consumer: void
@enduml
